  "terms": "**Licence and terms.** Each archive's own README.txt states *Licence: CC BY 4.0* and asks for the citation below; the OpenSky Network's General Terms of Use & Data License Agreement (shipped with its other published datasets) also restrict use to non-profit research, education, or internal testing and evaluation, forbid redistributing the data, and require aircraft identifiers to be anonymised in publications and a copy of or link to any publication to be sent to OpenSky. To satisfy both, the archives are never committed (they are downloaded into the git-ignored `recordings/` directory and verified by SHA-256), no derived fixture is committed, and no address, callsign or registration appears in the results. Data: The OpenSky Network, https://opensky-network.org. Citation: M. Schäfer, M. Strohmeier, V. Lenders, I. Martinovic and M. Wilhelm, *Bringing up OpenSky: A large-scale ADS-B sensor network for research*, IPSN 2014.",
